invariant: INV-36
file: tls.h
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: ch_connect returns its result code without CH_MUST_USE, so a
  caller that drops the code and writes to a session whose handshake
  failed gets no warning from the compiler. tools/must-use.py requires the
  mark on each public call that returns int.

--- old
int CH_MUST_USE ch_connect(ch_tls *t, const ch_cfg *cfg);
--- new
int ch_connect(ch_tls *t, const ch_cfg *cfg);
